WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:10.270
Brought to you by Guodong Subs

00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:13.360
We do not own the copyright. Only for academic exchange purpose.
Welcome to watch it on the official channel

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:24.860
Pass through boundaries of life and death, stride over the peak of the sky

00:00:24.860 --> 00:00:32.060
Look at this dim dark sky from the distance

00:00:38.730 --> 00:00:42.190
Glowing tears on fair skin

00:00:42.930 --> 00:00:47.930
Melt this dark night

00:00:48.390 --> 00:00:52.730
Souls entwine both on watch

00:00:52.930 --> 00:00:58.460
Protect the candle-like warmth

00:00:59.190 --> 00:01:03.790
Under the night sky sunflowers are swaying in the wind

00:01:04.060 --> 00:01:06.390
As the night will always pass by

00:01:06.390 --> 00:01:11.260
Let's embrace the new dawn

00:01:12.590 --> 00:01:14.990
Fleeting Meteor

00:01:14.990 --> 00:01:18.390
Broke the silence of the sky

00:01:18.390 --> 00:01:22.730
Call for new heroes with my remaining brightness

00:01:22.730 --> 00:01:25.260
Burn out the flame of life in the wind

00:01:25.260 --> 00:01:27.590
Penetrate the endless horizon

00:01:27.590 --> 00:01:29.930
Cross over the long night to another end

00:01:29.930 --> 00:01:32.990
Search for that destination

00:01:32.990 --> 00:01:35.660
Fly towards the other side of my dream

00:01:40.160 --> 00:01:42.360
Episode 11

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:00.800
Master, you made it

00:02:04.660 --> 00:02:06.930
Did… did I really do that?

00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:10.330
Master, you can utilize the transferring of spirit energy like you just did

00:02:10.530 --> 00:02:12.460
to use the low level Art that you have already obtained

00:02:14.260 --> 00:02:15.530
Low level Art?

00:02:17.600 --> 00:02:19.530
I got it, volitation

00:02:31.330 --> 00:02:33.130
Congratulations, master now knows how to use spirit energy

00:02:34.200 --> 00:02:34.730
Thanks

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:38.330
But why was there a tree spirit?

00:02:38.860 --> 00:02:41.060
Although I've stayed here for long amounts of time

00:02:41.660 --> 00:02:44.130
I still don’t know all the secrets of Hun Tian Beads

00:02:44.860 --> 00:02:47.530
All I know is that there is a lot of spirit energy here

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:51.400
The concentration here is far beyond that of the outside world

00:02:51.860 --> 00:02:56.400
Just like…the concentration of spirit energy in the ancient times

00:02:57.800 --> 00:03:02.060
The ancient times…but why is there so little spirit energy today?

00:03:02.060 --> 00:03:06.060
It seems that something significant must have happened back then

00:03:08.660 --> 00:03:11.660
Muzi is calling me? There's a phone signal here?

00:03:11.800 --> 00:03:14.800
Yingxiong, I need you to come with me, we need to prepare

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:16.330
Hm, ok

00:03:21.860 --> 00:03:22.530
Here it is

00:03:23.630 --> 00:03:27.160
(night time adult products shop)

00:03:30.460 --> 00:03:33.660
This is…is really an upmarket place

00:03:34.060 --> 00:03:34.930
Could it be……

00:03:36.200 --> 00:03:39.400
What are you thinking? It’s a covert cultivation shop

00:03:39.930 --> 00:03:41.130
Cultivation shop?

00:03:42.260 --> 00:03:44.530
I paid too much attention to the details

00:03:45.930 --> 00:03:49.130
I didn’t expect there to be cultivation shops like this anymore

00:03:49.530 --> 00:03:51.400
But what does adult products mean?

00:03:53.860 --> 00:03:58.060
It’s magical items or magic treasures that used by elder cultivators

00:03:59.330 --> 00:04:03.200
I see, it seems the development of the cultivation world has been quite tremendous

00:04:05.860 --> 00:04:07.060
We have guests

00:04:07.130 --> 00:04:08.860
entertain them well, you guys

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:10.930
Leave it to us landlady

00:04:15.730 --> 00:04:17.260
Welcome to our shop

00:04:17.330 --> 00:04:21.860
Night is the time for entertainment, what do you need?

00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:26.000
(music)

00:04:28.860 --> 00:04:31.800
Sorry, I played the wrong music

00:04:36.060 --> 00:04:40.860
How about this? Do you feel a kind of impulse?

00:04:43.000 --> 00:04:45.330
Take some adult products~

00:04:45.660 --> 00:04:46.060
(stop)

00:04:52.660 --> 00:04:54.860
So you're a cultivator

00:04:55.330 --> 00:04:56.060
Welcome

00:04:56.530 --> 00:04:58.260
That was an Apple computer

00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:00.400
Put it on my account

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:02.000
and tell your boss to come out

00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:04.860
This is

00:05:06.400 --> 00:05:10.400
A knob cobalt eloth golden diamond card of the night VIP

00:05:11.530 --> 00:05:14.400
I’ll take you to meet our boss now

00:05:17.800 --> 00:05:21.000
But, you can’t get in

00:05:21.600 --> 00:05:25.400
Only the owner of the golden diamond card is allowed in

00:05:25.600 --> 00:05:26.130
Yingxiong

00:05:27.800 --> 00:05:30.330
Just have a look around here, we'll converge outside later

00:05:33.130 --> 00:05:35.730
This Miss, please take me home~

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:36.660
What is this?

00:05:37.130 --> 00:05:40.730
Master, this is a low level spirit stone, the currency of the cultivation world

00:05:41.260 --> 00:05:42.660
This is a spirit stone!

00:05:43.200 --> 00:05:45.000
It looks like a jewel

00:05:45.460 --> 00:05:48.260
Such a bumpkin, greenhorn, I’ll entrap you

00:05:49.040 --> 00:05:52.110
How about having a look at our shop’s magical treasures?

00:05:52.440 --> 00:05:53.110
Magical treasures?

00:05:53.110 --> 00:05:54.170
Right, magical treasures

00:05:54.570 --> 00:05:59.370
I guarantee that they are a fair, low price

00:05:59.370 --> 00:06:02.040
Well, I do really need a suitable weapon

00:06:10.970 --> 00:06:13.970
This is a superman cloak, right? It can make me fly

00:06:15.910 --> 00:06:17.770
My dear guest, this is safeguard cloak

00:06:17.910 --> 00:06:20.910
You can use it to defend yourself while facing a measure of attacks of Art

00:06:21.170 --> 00:06:23.240
It only costs 500 low level spirit stones

00:06:23.710 --> 00:06:26.970
But our shop is running a promotion right now, 20% off if you buy more than three

00:06:29.110 --> 00:06:31.710
I don’t have enough money…Muzi gave me…

00:06:32.310 --> 00:06:35.110
This kind of spirit stone package should contain 50 low level spirit stones

00:06:36.710 --> 00:06:38.310
That seems…to not be enough

00:06:39.370 --> 00:06:41.970
Although you came here for the first time and I can offer you some discount

00:06:42.310 --> 00:06:44.240
the lowest price in our shop is still

00:06:44.440 --> 00:06:45.910
300 spirit stones

00:06:46.510 --> 00:06:48.240
Maybe this money can’t be spent

00:06:49.640 --> 00:06:51.640
I'll just save it for Muzi

00:06:55.840 --> 00:06:57.310
50 spirit stones are still spirit stones

00:06:57.710 --> 00:06:59.910
This bumpkin still doen’t know the value of 50 spirit stones

00:07:02.770 --> 00:07:04.440
Although you don't have enough sprit stones

00:07:04.710 --> 00:07:08.310
we can still provide you with some chances to get high value things

00:07:09.640 --> 00:07:10.440
Tell me more

00:07:10.710 --> 00:07:12.040
Have you head of Gamble Stone before?

00:07:13.210 --> 00:07:14.010
What is that?

00:07:14.370 --> 00:07:17.710
Gamble Stone is a kind of game that's played with Jade and luck

00:07:18.440 --> 00:07:20.910
When the original Jade stones are dug up

00:07:21.240 --> 00:07:23.770
they are covered with a weathered stone skin

00:07:24.310 --> 00:07:26.440
We don't know the quality of the jade inside the stone

00:07:27.170 --> 00:07:29.640
These original stones are used for gambling

00:07:30.370 --> 00:07:34.110
Guests can buy an original stone at a low price

00:07:34.510 --> 00:07:36.510
and it may lead them to sudden wealth

00:07:38.040 --> 00:07:40.510
I didn’t expect that magical treasures would be used for gambling like this

00:07:41.040 --> 00:07:44.370
Of course, we can offer such bargains this way

00:07:47.040 --> 00:07:48.640
Ling Er, how about giving it a try?

00:07:49.110 --> 00:07:50.170
Master can have a try

00:07:50.440 --> 00:07:52.640
Ok, then I’ll have a try

00:07:52.710 --> 00:07:55.770
Getting bumpkin’s money is so easy

00:08:00.370 --> 00:08:02.510
This really is the VIP card for our shop

00:08:02.970 --> 00:08:06.170
And according our records, in the last one hundred years

00:08:06.370 --> 00:08:10.440
the only card given was to the cultivation Li family

00:08:11.170 --> 00:08:11.910
You seem to remember clearly

00:08:13.710 --> 00:08:17.040
I’m Maimaizi, the head of the JingDu Branch Shop

00:08:17.370 --> 00:08:20.240
Then I'll get to the point, I want the most value magical treasure in the shop

00:08:21.240 --> 00:08:22.710
Boss, this…

00:08:22.910 --> 00:08:27.640
Nothing, but my guest, but I will need to take the card back

00:08:28.570 --> 00:08:29.040
No problem

00:08:31.440 --> 00:08:34.110
Please wait, I’ll get it for you

00:08:38.170 --> 00:08:40.570
Boss, can we really sell that magical treasure?

00:08:41.370 --> 00:08:45.310
It only can defend user under a deadly flow when struck by a lower level than Nascent Soul

00:08:45.570 --> 00:08:47.510
It’s not that useful anymore

00:08:49.770 --> 00:08:50.440
Boss

00:08:50.840 --> 00:08:55.170
The head office ordered that all Night branch offices need to be shut down in three days

00:08:56.510 --> 00:09:01.440
Spirit stone magical treasures need to be turned in,  a branch magical treasure isn't that important

00:09:02.510 --> 00:09:07.840
And the real important magical treasure isn't any of these nominal treasures

00:09:08.110 --> 00:09:09.840
There's a more precious magical treasure?

00:09:11.510 --> 00:09:13.840
But boss, why are they shutting down the shop?

00:09:13.840 --> 00:09:15.310
They said just one thing

00:09:15.640 --> 00:09:16.840
That person is coming

00:09:17.310 --> 00:09:21.970
And they seem to have something to do with this Li family

00:09:24.310 --> 00:09:27.510
These boxes were sealed by our Nascent Soul senior

00:09:27.840 --> 00:09:30.310
The boxes themselves are also valuable

00:09:31.510 --> 00:09:34.640
It won’t be that bad even if you just get the worst box

00:09:35.310 --> 00:09:36.440
Ling Er, what do you think?

00:09:37.240 --> 00:09:38.440
Master can have a try

00:09:39.110 --> 00:09:42.770
Master, a simple Nascent Soul seal is nothing to me

00:09:42.770 --> 00:09:44.840
I will pick the best magical treasure for you

00:09:46.110 --> 00:09:46.510
Then let's do it…

00:10:02.640 --> 00:10:04.770
Ling Er, which do you think is good?

00:10:07.310 --> 00:10:07.970
This one

00:10:09.170 --> 00:10:10.910
This? Have you chosen it?

00:10:11.640 --> 00:10:13.570
Please finalize your bet, 50 spirit stones

00:10:17.910 --> 00:10:19.970
The package doesn't look so good

00:10:22.240 --> 00:10:24.170
But in this shop

00:10:24.910 --> 00:10:27.840
maybe they hide the good treasures in ordinary boxes

00:10:28.710 --> 00:10:30.040
Yeah, yeah

00:10:30.310 --> 00:10:31.770
Let me unseal it for you

00:10:31.910 --> 00:10:34.710
You need our key if you are in a low Cultivation Base

00:10:35.710 --> 00:10:36.170
Open it

00:10:42.240 --> 00:10:43.240
This is…

00:10:44.770 --> 00:10:48.440
Ha ha, it’s just a rusted dagger

00:10:50.910 --> 00:10:52.040
Congratulations

00:10:53.170 --> 00:10:57.440
It says the soul of dragon blood, what a cool name

00:11:03.110 --> 00:11:04.710
It's just a dagger

00:11:04.710 --> 00:11:06.510
Alright alright

00:11:06.570 --> 00:11:08.440
A bet is a bet

00:11:11.310 --> 00:11:12.710
Don’t forget the box

00:11:12.970 --> 00:11:14.570
You said the box is also a good treasure

00:11:15.110 --> 00:11:16.040
Yes, my guest

00:11:17.510 --> 00:11:18.370
Bye-bye

00:11:19.040 --> 00:11:21.510
Take care, come back sometime

00:11:29.910 --> 00:11:31.040
Boss, boss

00:11:32.510 --> 00:11:36.510
I just sold a bet box and made a great profit

00:11:37.310 --> 00:11:40.510
You made a great profit before closing the door, that's really good

00:11:41.040 --> 00:11:42.370
Wait, did you unseal it?

00:11:42.710 --> 00:11:46.770
Yes, it was just a dagger called the soul of dragon blood

00:11:46.970 --> 00:11:48.620
We made a great profit

00:11:48.750 --> 00:11:50.490
That was very valuable…

00:11:52.550 --> 00:11:56.550
Boss, boss, what’s the matter with you? boss

00:12:01.390 --> 00:12:08.120
Waken at nightfall    It's the whisper of waves

00:12:08.120 --> 00:12:13.920
The scenery outside the window is dyed red by the afterglow

00:12:15.250 --> 00:12:22.320
Blank mood
Scattered time

00:12:22.320 --> 00:12:27.050
No one is along with me to the dawn time

00:12:28.320 --> 00:12:35.390
Ear is listening
Wind is passed

00:12:35.390 --> 00:12:40.920
Could I hear the sound of your heart beat?

00:12:41.790 --> 00:12:48.920
Let this wind blows hair to the air

00:12:48.920 --> 00:12:55.720
Bit bit drops into my heart
Pitter-patter is perpetual

00:12:55.720 --> 00:13:02.720
Rose in the vase rises her white body sideways

00:13:02.720 --> 00:13:07.850
It rejects of dying alone
